# --- ReviewGate-R execution-model study (analysis/syncasync) ---
# The read-only seed DB is rebuilt byte-identically by build_db.py and its
# sha256 is recorded in the pre-registration, so the binary is not tracked.
# Smoke cell output is provenance only and is never analysed.
