# --- R=40 experiment raw artifacts (2026-09-28) ---
# The per-request k6 output and the knee ramp CSVs are 21GB / 260MB. The
# run-level aggregates they reduce to ARE tracked, so the analysis is
# reproducible from the repo without the raw per-request dumps.
analysis/out/experiment/standalone_R40/knee_A.csv
analysis/out/experiment/standalone_R40/knee_B.csv
analysis/out/experiment/standalone_R40/steady/
analysis/experiment/results/steady/

# 3.1GB per-request dump for the two failing A.480 cells; the diagnosis
